:: Statement-only formalization of thousand-theorems corpus artifact Q656645,
:: "Hilbert's basis theorem": for every commutative ring, Noetherianity of the
:: coefficient ring implies Noetherianity of its univariate polynomial ring.
:: This file contains no proof.

environ

 vocabularies ARYTM_3, FUNCT_1, RELAT_1, CARD_3, XBOOLE_0, TARSKI, XCMPLX_0,
      STRUCT_0, SUBSET_1, SUPINF_2, NAT_1, CARD_1, MESFUNC1, GROUP_1, ARYTM_1,
